<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Protector 2 - 115,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Rotterdam $6.95 fio scale load/25,000 shinc 1-15/4 Cobelfret.</p>
<p>Royal Clipper - 105,000 tonnes coal Hampton Roads/Constanza approx. $7.50 fio 30,000 shinc/15,000 shinc end Mar AMCI (reported).</p>
<p>Marshal Konev - 80,000 tonnes coal Norfolk/Richards Bay $8.50 fio three days shinc/12,000 shinc 12-22/3 Safore.</p>
<p>Ocean Cherry - 55,000 tonnes coal Roberts Bank/ARA $13 fio 25,000 shinc/15,000 shinc end Mar Korea Line.</p>
</text>
